    "body": "I think this is pretty clear when you read the sentence right before the one you quoted:\r\n\r\n> When the element is [suffering from a step mismatch](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/form-control-infrastructure.html#suffering-from-a-step-mismatch), the user agent must round the element's [value](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/form-control-infrastructure.html#concept-fe-value) to the nearest number for which the element would not [suffer from a step mismatch](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/form-control-infrastructure.html#suffering-from-a-step-mismatch)\r\n\r\nThat is, the example is showing how the rounding works.",
